          {
            "date": "Aug 9, 2024",
            "id": "4486b3d7-a00c-4565-a432-584cbfb25b1e",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Hi, Karen. We are delighted you had a 5-star stay at Azzurro Moon, and the home had everything needed for an exceptional family getaway. It was our pleasure to host you, and we hope to welcome you back to the beach soon!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "I always worry when I book a house for our family’s summer vacation! This summer, we hit the jackpot! This house was everything we could have dreamed about! Every room was gorgeous down to the smallest details! The kitchen was a cook’s dream! The elevator was great, especially for us grandparents. The golf cart, beach chair setup, and bicycles were an added bonus! We felt like we were in heaven! We loved every aspect of our 2024 summer vacation!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Stunning",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Angela C.",
