        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Beautiful property! We thoroughly enjoyed our stay at Azzurro Moon. The house is well equipped, especially the kitchen. Inclusion of the beach chair set-up, golfcart and bikes was very nice. We really enjoyed the private beach access right off the front door. We would love to stay here again!",
        "themes": [
